post_install() {
  cat <<'EOF'
SonoJot is installed. Start it from the app launcher or run `SonoJot`.

On Hyprland, SonoJot binds its dictation shortcut itself: it writes
~/.config/hypr/sonojot.lua (sonojot.conf on older configs) and adds one line
that loads it to ~/.config/hypr/bindings.lua. Change the shortcut in
SonoJot > Settings > Shortcuts. Remove that line to undo.
EOF
}

post_upgrade() {
  echo "Restart SonoJot to use the new version."
}
